{"id":"hsk2_bai2_liudian_qichuang-xiaomei","title":"我每天六点起床","titleVi":"Mỗi ngày tôi dậy lúc 6 giờ","sourceText":"小美每天很忙。她每天早上六点起床，去跑步。跑步以后，她觉得身体很好。可是她这个星期很累，因为工作太多，没有时间休息。她的朋友问她：“你是不是生病了？”小美说：“没有，我没有生病，我很忙。”","questions":[],"translations":[],"curriculum":{"id":"hsk2_bai2_liudian_qichuang","level":"2","lessonNo":2,"title":"我每天六点起床","href":"bai2_index.html","standardVersion":"HSK 2.0"},"provenance":{"source":"data/lessons/hsk2/bai2.js","sourceVersion":"b7d80216c621c35a","license":"project-content","sourceRefs":[],"lessonId":"hsk2_bai2_liudian_qichuang"},"visibility":"public","lessonId":"hsk2_bai2_liudian_qichuang"}